  "label": "Stereotype of Being Great at One Thing but Terrible at Another",
  "description": "This is a common cultural trope or stereotype that describes individuals who excel in one specific area but are perceived as incompetent or inept in other areas. The meme uses this concept to create humor by applying it to an inanimate object, thereby mocking the stereotype itself through absurdity. It is not a targeted stereotype against any specific group but a general comedic device.",
